MD
      ;;
    bootstrap)
      cat <<'MD'
- `bootstrap/` Bootstrap.
  - `docs/` the documentation site sources (`.mdx`): `components/`,
    `forms/`, `layout/`, `utilities/`, `helpers/`, `content/`,
    `customize/` (Sass variables, color modes, CSS variables).
  - `scss/` the Sass source; `_variables.scss`, `_maps.scss` and
    `_utilities.scss` are the customisation points.
MD
      ;;
    turbo)
      cat <<'MD'
- `turbo/` Turbo: `handbook/` (Drive, page refreshes, Frames, Streams,
  native), `reference/` (attributes, drive, events, frames, streams),
  `turbo-rails-README.md` (Rails helpers), `turbo-js-README.md`.
MD
      ;;
    stimulus)
      cat <<'MD'
- `stimulus/` Stimulus: `handbook/`, `reference/` (controllers, actions,
  targets, values, outlets, css classes, lifecycle callbacks, TypeScript),
